WEBVTT

00:02:57.784 --> 00:03:01.405
We are not allowed to declare
whom we are working with.

00:03:02.807 --> 00:03:04.570
The reason why I speak to you

00:03:04.594 --> 00:03:08.974
is because the world should know
that we are here.

00:03:10.544 --> 00:03:13.347
There is somebody
who is checking the social media.

00:03:14.317 --> 00:03:17.921
We are doing our best
to make this platform

00:03:17.945 --> 00:03:19.735
safe for all of them.